  <diagram name="Page-1" id="qHN5iOu-XmM6noES-Wey">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1030" dy="660" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:24px&quot;&gt;NexaMeet — Complete Functionalities Catalogue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Functional Requirements &amp;amp; System Capabilities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Product: NexaMeet&lt;br&gt;Category: University Collaboration &amp;amp; Intelligent Meeting Platform&lt;br&gt;Core Concept: Connect. Collaborate. Understand. Act." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="1660" x="40" y="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Authentication &amp;amp; Identity Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Identity and authentication management&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.1 Registration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create a new account.&lt;br&gt;• Enter full name.&lt;br&gt;• Enter email address.&lt;br&gt;• Enter password.&lt;br&gt;• Confirm password.&lt;br&gt;• Accept terms of use and privacy policy.&lt;br&gt;• Email verification.&lt;br&gt;• Prevent creating accounts with duplicate emails.&lt;br&gt;• Validate entered data.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.2 Login&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Log in with email and password.&lt;br&gt;• Validate login credentials.&lt;br&gt;• User session management.&lt;br&gt;• Remember the user when selected.&lt;br&gt;• Log out.&lt;br&gt;• Log out from all devices.&lt;br&gt;• Show clear error messages when login fails.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.3 Password Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Request password recovery.&lt;br&gt;• Send reset link.&lt;br&gt;• Validate link validity.&lt;br&gt;• Set a new password.&lt;br&gt;• Invalidate reset links after use.&lt;br&gt;• End old sessions when the password changes according to security policy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.4 User Profile&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• View profile.&lt;br&gt;• Edit name.&lt;br&gt;• Edit profile picture.&lt;br&gt;• Edit personal bio.&lt;br&gt;• Edit contact information.&lt;br&gt;• Change password.&lt;br&gt;• Change language.&lt;br&gt;• Set time zone.&lt;br&gt;• View workspaces the user belongs to.&lt;br&gt;• View basic user activity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.5 Account Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Deactivate account.&lt;br&gt;• Request account deletion.&lt;br&gt;• Log out.&lt;br&gt;• Manage active sessions.&lt;br&gt;• View connected devices when supported." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="720" width="400" x="40" y="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Workspace Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Workspace management&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.1 Workspace Creation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create a new workspace.&lt;br&gt;• Set workspace name.&lt;br&gt;• Add description.&lt;br&gt;• Choose an image or logo.&lt;br&gt;• Set organization or team type.&lt;br&gt;• Set workspace settings.&lt;br&gt;• Assign the creator as owner.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.2 Workspace Navigation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• View all workspaces the user belongs to.&lt;br&gt;• Switch between workspaces.&lt;br&gt;• Show the active workspace.&lt;br&gt;• Search for a workspace.&lt;br&gt;• Leave a workspace.&lt;br&gt;• Show current workspace data.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.3 Workspace Settings&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Edit name and description.&lt;br&gt;• Edit logo.&lt;br&gt;• Set privacy settings.&lt;br&gt;• Manage invitations.&lt;br&gt;• Manage members.&lt;br&gt;• Set notification settings.&lt;br&gt;• Set file and recording policies.&lt;br&gt;• Delete workspace according to owner permissions and data retention policy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.4 Workspace Members&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• View members.&lt;br&gt;• Search for a member.&lt;br&gt;• Invite a new member.&lt;br&gt;• Accept invitations.&lt;br&gt;• Decline invitations.&lt;br&gt;• Cancel sent invitations.&lt;br&gt;• Resend invitation.&lt;br&gt;• Change a member&#39;s role.&lt;br&gt;• Remove a member.&lt;br&gt;• View join date.&lt;br&gt;• View membership status." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="616" width="400" x="40" y="936" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="&lt;b&gt;3. Roles &amp;amp; Permissions — RBAC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Roles and permissions management&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.1 Default Roles&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Owner.&lt;br&gt;• Administrator.&lt;br&gt;• Teacher.&lt;br&gt;• Student.&lt;br&gt;• Member.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.2 Role Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create custom roles when supported.&lt;br&gt;• Edit role name.&lt;br&gt;• Set role permissions.&lt;br&gt;• Delete custom roles.&lt;br&gt;• Assign a role to a user.&lt;br&gt;• Change a user&#39;s role.&lt;br&gt;• View the permissions linked to each role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.3 Permission Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create Workspace.&lt;br&gt;• Edit Workspace.&lt;br&gt;• Delete Workspace.&lt;br&gt;• Invite users.&lt;br&gt;• Remove users.&lt;br&gt;• Create projects.&lt;br&gt;• Edit projects.&lt;br&gt;• Delete projects.&lt;br&gt;• Manage tasks.&lt;br&gt;• Create channels.&lt;br&gt;• Manage messages.&lt;br&gt;• Create meetings.&lt;br&gt;• Record meetings.&lt;br&gt;• View recordings.&lt;br&gt;• Upload files.&lt;br&gt;• Delete files.&lt;br&gt;• Manage organization settings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.4 Access Control&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Verify permissions in the Backend.&lt;br&gt;• Prevent access to another workspace&#39;s resources.&lt;br&gt;• Prevent access to unauthorized projects.&lt;br&gt;• Verify permission to view recordings.&lt;br&gt;• Verify permission to download files.&lt;br&gt;• Verify permission to join meetings.&lt;br&gt;• Log sensitive operations in Audit Logs." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="680" width="400" x="40" y="1568" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Team Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Team management&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.1 Team Creation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create a team.&lt;br&gt;• Set team name.&lt;br&gt;• Add description.&lt;br&gt;• Choose an image.&lt;br&gt;• Link the team to a workspace.&lt;br&gt;• Assign a team lead.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.2 Team Members&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Add members.&lt;br&gt;• Remove members.&lt;br&gt;• View member list.&lt;br&gt;• Change team lead.&lt;br&gt;• Set member roles.&lt;br&gt;• View team activities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.3 Team Organization&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create teams for university departments.&lt;br&gt;• Create teams for graduation projects.&lt;br&gt;• Create research teams.&lt;br&gt;• Link projects to teams.&lt;br&gt;• Link channels to teams." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="360" width="400" x="40" y="2264" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;5. Project Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Project management&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5.1 Project Creation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create a project.&lt;br&gt;• Enter project name.&lt;br&gt;• Enter project description.&lt;br&gt;• Set start date.&lt;br&gt;• Set end date.&lt;br&gt;• Set project status.&lt;br&gt;• Set priority.&lt;br&gt;• Choose project members.&lt;br&gt;• Assign a project manager.&lt;br&gt;• Link the project to a team.&lt;br&gt;• Link the project to a workspace.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5.2 Project Details&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• View project information.&lt;br&gt;• View project members.&lt;br&gt;• View tasks.&lt;br&gt;• View files.&lt;br&gt;• View linked channels.&lt;br&gt;• View linked meetings.&lt;br&gt;• View meeting summaries.&lt;br&gt;• View recent activities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5.3 Project Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Edit project data.&lt;br&gt;• Archive the project.&lt;br&gt;• Restore an archived project.&lt;br&gt;• Delete the project according to permissions.&lt;br&gt;• Add members.&lt;br&gt;• Remove members.&lt;br&gt;• Set the project owner.&lt;br&gt;• Track project progress.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5.4 Project Search &amp;amp; Filtering&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Search for projects.&lt;br&gt;• Filter by status.&lt;br&gt;• Filter by owner.&lt;br&gt;• Filter by team.&lt;br&gt;• Filter by date.&lt;br&gt;• Sort projects.&lt;br&gt;• View active and archived projects." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="650" width="400" x="40" y="2640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-7" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;6. Task Management — Kanban&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Task management&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6.1 Task Creation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create a task.&lt;br&gt;• Enter task title.&lt;br&gt;• Enter description.&lt;br&gt;• Set the project.&lt;br&gt;• Set the assignee.&lt;br&gt;• Set priority.&lt;br&gt;• Set due date.&lt;br&gt;• Add Labels.&lt;br&gt;• Attach files.&lt;br&gt;• Add a subtask checklist.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6.2 Task Status&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• To Do.&lt;br&gt;• In Progress.&lt;br&gt;• In Review.&lt;br&gt;• Done.&lt;br&gt;• Cancelled.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6.3 Kanban Board&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Show tasks in columns.&lt;br&gt;• Move tasks between columns.&lt;br&gt;• Drag &amp;amp;amp; Drop.&lt;br&gt;• Update task status.&lt;br&gt;• View tasks by assignee.&lt;br&gt;• View tasks by priority.&lt;br&gt;• View overdue tasks.&lt;br&gt;• View completed tasks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6.4 Task Details&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• View task details.&lt;br&gt;• Edit the task.&lt;br&gt;• Delete the task.&lt;br&gt;• Change the assignee.&lt;br&gt;• Change the deadline.&lt;br&gt;• Add a comment.&lt;br&gt;• View edit history.&lt;br&gt;• View linked files.&lt;br&gt;• Show the task source if extracted from a meeting.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6.5 Subtasks &amp;amp;amp; Dependencies&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create subtasks.&lt;br&gt;• Track subtask completion.&lt;br&gt;• Link tasks to each other.&lt;br&gt;• Define preceding and following tasks when supported.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6.6 Task Notifications&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Notify the user when a task is assigned to them.&lt;br&gt;• Notify when the deadline changes.&lt;br&gt;• Notify when a comment is added.&lt;br&gt;• Notify when the due date is approaching.&lt;br&gt;• Notify when overdue." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="800" width="400" x="460" y="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-8" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;7. Real-Time Messaging&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Real-time messaging system&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7.1 Channels&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create a channel.&lt;br&gt;• Set channel name.&lt;br&gt;• Add description.&lt;br&gt;• Create a public channel.&lt;br&gt;• Create a private channel.&lt;br&gt;• Link the channel to a project.&lt;br&gt;• Add members.&lt;br&gt;• Remove members.&lt;br&gt;• Edit channel data.&lt;br&gt;• Archive the channel.&lt;br&gt;• Delete the channel according to permissions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7.2 Direct Messages&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Start a direct conversation.&lt;br&gt;• Send a message to a user.&lt;br&gt;• View conversation list.&lt;br&gt;• Search for a conversation.&lt;br&gt;• View recent conversations.&lt;br&gt;• Archive the conversation when supported.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7.3 Message Operations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Send a text message.&lt;br&gt;• Edit a message.&lt;br&gt;• Delete a message.&lt;br&gt;• Reply to a message.&lt;br&gt;• Add Reactions.&lt;br&gt;• Mention a user using Mentions.&lt;br&gt;• Send links.&lt;br&gt;• Attach files.&lt;br&gt;• Show send time.&lt;br&gt;• Show delivery status.&lt;br&gt;• Show read status when supported.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7.4 Real-Time Features&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Receive messages in real time.&lt;br&gt;• Update messages without reloading the page.&lt;br&gt;• Show online users.&lt;br&gt;• Show Typing Indicator.&lt;br&gt;• Notify of new message arrival.&lt;br&gt;• Sync conversations on reconnection.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7.5 Message Search&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Search for text within messages.&lt;br&gt;• Search by sender.&lt;br&gt;• Search by channel.&lt;br&gt;• Search by date.&lt;br&gt;• Filter messages containing files.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7.6 Message Security&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Verify the user&#39;s channel membership.&lt;br&gt;• Prevent access to unauthorized conversations.&lt;br&gt;• Verify permission to send messages.&lt;br&gt;• Protect attachments.&lt;br&gt;• Apply message retention policy." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="850" width="400" x="460" y="1016" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-9" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&lt;b&gt;8. File Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;File and document management&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8.1 File Upload&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Upload a file.&lt;br&gt;• Upload multiple files.&lt;br&gt;• Show upload progress.&lt;br&gt;• Validate file type.&lt;br&gt;• Validate size.&lt;br&gt;• Link the file to a workspace.&lt;br&gt;• Link the file to a project.&lt;br&gt;• Link the file to a meeting.&lt;br&gt;• Link the file to a message.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8.2 File Organization&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create folders.&lt;br&gt;• Rename a file.&lt;br&gt;• Move a file.&lt;br&gt;• Move a file between folders.&lt;br&gt;• Sort files.&lt;br&gt;• Filter by type.&lt;br&gt;• Search for files.&lt;br&gt;• View recent files.&lt;br&gt;• View files shared by the user.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8.3 File Operations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Preview supported files.&lt;br&gt;• Download files.&lt;br&gt;• Delete files.&lt;br&gt;• Restore deleted files when supported.&lt;br&gt;• Show file size.&lt;br&gt;• Show file type.&lt;br&gt;• Show upload date.&lt;br&gt;• Show file owner.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8.4 File Permissions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Define who can view the file.&lt;br&gt;• Define who can download it.&lt;br&gt;• Define who can delete it.&lt;br&gt;• Create temporary download links.&lt;br&gt;• Prevent unauthorized direct access.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8.5 Storage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Store files in MinIO.&lt;br&gt;• Store Metadata in PostgreSQL.&lt;br&gt;• Manage storage paths.&lt;br&gt;• Verify file integrity.&lt;br&gt;• Apply retention and deletion policies." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="700" width="400" x="460" y="1882" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-10" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" value="&lt;b&gt;9. Meeting Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Meeting management&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9.1 Meeting Creation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create a meeting.&lt;br&gt;• Set meeting title.&lt;br&gt;• Add description.&lt;br&gt;• Set meeting date.&lt;br&gt;• Set start time.&lt;br&gt;• Set duration.&lt;br&gt;• Choose participants.&lt;br&gt;• Set the linked project.&lt;br&gt;• Set the linked channel.&lt;br&gt;• Set meeting permissions.&lt;br&gt;• Generate join link.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9.2 Meeting Scheduling&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Schedule a future meeting.&lt;br&gt;• View upcoming meetings.&lt;br&gt;• Edit meeting time.&lt;br&gt;• Cancel the meeting.&lt;br&gt;• Send invitations.&lt;br&gt;• View invitation status.&lt;br&gt;• Remind participants.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9.3 Meeting Joining&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Join a meeting.&lt;br&gt;• Verify user identity.&lt;br&gt;• Verify entry permission.&lt;br&gt;• Issue a LiveKit Access Token.&lt;br&gt;• Enter the LiveKit room.&lt;br&gt;• Leave the meeting.&lt;br&gt;• Reconnect on network interruption.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9.4 In-Meeting Features&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Turn camera on.&lt;br&gt;• Turn camera off.&lt;br&gt;• Turn microphone on.&lt;br&gt;• Mute microphone.&lt;br&gt;• Choose audio device.&lt;br&gt;• Choose camera.&lt;br&gt;• Share screen.&lt;br&gt;• Stop screen sharing.&lt;br&gt;• View participants.&lt;br&gt;• Show speaker name.&lt;br&gt;• Show microphone status.&lt;br&gt;• Chat during the meeting.&lt;br&gt;• View meeting information.&lt;br&gt;• End the meeting.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9.5 Host Controls&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Admit participants when waiting room is enabled.&lt;br&gt;• Reject participants.&lt;br&gt;• Mute a participant according to permissions.&lt;br&gt;• Remove a participant.&lt;br&gt;• Control recording.&lt;br&gt;• End the meeting for everyone.&lt;br&gt;• Manage participation permissions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9.6 Recording&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Start recording.&lt;br&gt;• Stop recording.&lt;br&gt;• Show recording indicator.&lt;br&gt;• Notify participants of recording.&lt;br&gt;• Receive recording status.&lt;br&gt;• Store the recording in MinIO.&lt;br&gt;• Link the recording to the meeting.&lt;br&gt;• Show recording status.&lt;br&gt;• View recordings.&lt;br&gt;• Download the recording according to permissions.&lt;br&gt;• Delete the recording according to organization policy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9.7 Meeting History&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• View past meetings.&lt;br&gt;• View upcoming meetings.&lt;br&gt;• View participants.&lt;br&gt;• View start and end time.&lt;br&gt;• View meeting duration.&lt;br&gt;• View the recording.&lt;br&gt;• View meeting summary.&lt;br&gt;• View extracted tasks." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1200" width="400" x="460" y="2598" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-11" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" value="&lt;b&gt;10. LiveKit Integration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Communication infrastructure integration&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.1 Room Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create a room when needed.&lt;br&gt;• Link the room to a NexaMeet meeting.&lt;br&gt;• Set room name.&lt;br&gt;• Manage participants.&lt;br&gt;• End the room.&lt;br&gt;• Prevent unauthorized access.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.2 Access Token Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Verify the user.&lt;br&gt;• Verify their membership.&lt;br&gt;• Verify meeting validity.&lt;br&gt;• Issue an Access Token.&lt;br&gt;• Set Room Grants.&lt;br&gt;• Set publish and subscribe permissions.&lt;br&gt;• Set token lifetime.&lt;br&gt;• Do not expose the API Secret to the client.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.3 Media Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Publish audio.&lt;br&gt;• Publish video.&lt;br&gt;• Receive media streams.&lt;br&gt;• Support screen sharing.&lt;br&gt;• Handle connection quality.&lt;br&gt;• Support Simulcast when needed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.4 Egress Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Request meeting recording.&lt;br&gt;• Track recording status.&lt;br&gt;• Receive the recording-completed event.&lt;br&gt;• Save the recording location.&lt;br&gt;• Update the database.&lt;br&gt;• Handle recording failure.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;10.5 Webhooks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Receive Participant Joined.&lt;br&gt;• Receive Participant Left.&lt;br&gt;• Receive Room Started.&lt;br&gt;• Receive Room Finished.&lt;br&gt;• Receive Egress Started.&lt;br&gt;• Receive Egress Ended.&lt;br&gt;• Verify the signature.&lt;br&gt;• Prevent duplicate event processing.&lt;br&gt;• Log events and errors." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="690" width="400" x="880" y="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-12" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" value="&lt;b&gt;11. AI Meeting Assistant&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Smart meeting assistant&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;11.1 AI Processing Activation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Activate meeting processing.&lt;br&gt;• Set the target language.&lt;br&gt;• Choose the processing type.&lt;br&gt;• Verify a valid recording exists.&lt;br&gt;• Verify user consent and organization policy.&lt;br&gt;• Create a Job in BullMQ.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;11.2 Audio Processing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Fetch the recording from MinIO.&lt;br&gt;• Extract the audio track.&lt;br&gt;• Convert audio to a suitable format.&lt;br&gt;• Split long recordings when needed.&lt;br&gt;• Manage temporary files.&lt;br&gt;• Clean up temporary files after processing ends.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;11.3 Speech-to-Text&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Send audio to Whisper.&lt;br&gt;• Set the language when needed.&lt;br&gt;• Extract text.&lt;br&gt;• Obtain timestamps when available.&lt;br&gt;• Save the text.&lt;br&gt;• Save time segments.&lt;br&gt;• Set processing status.&lt;br&gt;• Handle errors.&lt;br&gt;• Retry on failure.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;11.4 Transcript Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• View the full text.&lt;br&gt;• View segments.&lt;br&gt;• Navigate by timestamp.&lt;br&gt;• Search within the text.&lt;br&gt;• Correct the text.&lt;br&gt;• Edit the text according to permissions.&lt;br&gt;• Download the text.&lt;br&gt;• Keep a copy of the original text.&lt;br&gt;• Log edits.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;11.5 Meeting Summarization&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create an executive summary.&lt;br&gt;• Extract main topics.&lt;br&gt;• Identify important points.&lt;br&gt;• Identify open questions.&lt;br&gt;• Create a summary in the chosen language.&lt;br&gt;• Save the summary.&lt;br&gt;• Edit the summary.&lt;br&gt;• Regenerate the summary on request.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;11.6 Decision Extraction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Extract decisions.&lt;br&gt;• Describe the decision.&lt;br&gt;• Link the decision to a transcript segment.&lt;br&gt;• Determine whether the decision is confirmed or proposed.&lt;br&gt;• Show the decision for review.&lt;br&gt;• Accept the decision.&lt;br&gt;• Reject the decision.&lt;br&gt;• Edit the decision.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;11.7 Action Item Extraction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Extract suggested tasks.&lt;br&gt;• Create a task title.&lt;br&gt;• Create a description.&lt;br&gt;• Suggest the assignee when there is clear evidence.&lt;br&gt;• Suggest the deadline when there is clear evidence.&lt;br&gt;• Set confidence level.&lt;br&gt;• Link the task to the original text.&lt;br&gt;• Show the task for review.&lt;br&gt;• Edit the task.&lt;br&gt;• Accept the task.&lt;br&gt;• Reject the task.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;11.8 Human Review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Review the summary.&lt;br&gt;• Review decisions.&lt;br&gt;• Review tasks.&lt;br&gt;• Edit incorrect information.&lt;br&gt;• Accept results.&lt;br&gt;• Reject results.&lt;br&gt;• Approve a set of results.&lt;br&gt;• Create approved tasks inside the project.&lt;br&gt;• Save the approval log.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;11.9 AI Results Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• View meeting results.&lt;br&gt;• Reprocess the meeting.&lt;br&gt;• View processing status.&lt;br&gt;• View processing history.&lt;br&gt;• View processing errors.&lt;br&gt;• Compare processing results when versions are supported.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;11.10 AI Job Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create Jobs.&lt;br&gt;• Manage the Queue.&lt;br&gt;• Run Workers.&lt;br&gt;• Retry.&lt;br&gt;• Handle failed tasks.&lt;br&gt;• Prevent duplication.&lt;br&gt;• Track processing progress.&lt;br&gt;• Send a notification on completion." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1500" width="400" x="880" y="906" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-13" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;12. Notifications System&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Notifications system&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;12.1 Notification Events&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Invitation to a Workspace.&lt;br&gt;• Added to a Project.&lt;br&gt;• Task assigned.&lt;br&gt;• Task deadline approaching.&lt;br&gt;• Task overdue.&lt;br&gt;• Message received.&lt;br&gt;• User mentioned in a message.&lt;br&gt;• Invitation to a meeting.&lt;br&gt;• Meeting time changed.&lt;br&gt;• Meeting started.&lt;br&gt;• Recording completed.&lt;br&gt;• AI processing completed.&lt;br&gt;• New summary available.&lt;br&gt;• Tasks needing review.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;12.2 Notification Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• View notifications.&lt;br&gt;• Mark a notification as read.&lt;br&gt;• Mark all notifications as read.&lt;br&gt;• Delete a notification.&lt;br&gt;• Filter notifications.&lt;br&gt;• Show unread notification count.&lt;br&gt;• Go to the item linked to the notification.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;12.3 Notification Preferences&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Enable or disable notification types.&lt;br&gt;• Configure message notifications.&lt;br&gt;• Configure meeting notifications.&lt;br&gt;• Configure task notifications.&lt;br&gt;• Set available notification channels." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="500" width="400" x="880" y="2422" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-14" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;13. Search System&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Global search&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;13.1 Global Search&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Search for a user.&lt;br&gt;• Search for a project.&lt;br&gt;• Search for a task.&lt;br&gt;• Search for a channel.&lt;br&gt;• Search for a file.&lt;br&gt;• Search for a meeting.&lt;br&gt;• Search in messages.&lt;br&gt;• Search in meeting transcripts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;13.2 Search Filters&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Search by date.&lt;br&gt;• Search by user.&lt;br&gt;• Search by workspace.&lt;br&gt;• Search by project.&lt;br&gt;• Search by content type.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;13.3 Search Permissions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Do not show results the user has no permission to access.&lt;br&gt;• Apply access permissions before returning results." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="400" x="880" y="2938" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-15" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;14. Dashboard &amp;amp; Activity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Dashboard and activity&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;14.1 Personal Dashboard&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Show workspace summary.&lt;br&gt;• Show active projects.&lt;br&gt;• Show tasks assigned to the user.&lt;br&gt;• Show overdue tasks.&lt;br&gt;• Show upcoming meetings.&lt;br&gt;• Show recent messages.&lt;br&gt;• Show notifications.&lt;br&gt;• Show latest files.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;14.2 Activity Feed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Show project creation.&lt;br&gt;• Show task creation.&lt;br&gt;• Show task status changes.&lt;br&gt;• Show meeting-related activities.&lt;br&gt;• Show file uploads.&lt;br&gt;• Show member joins.&lt;br&gt;• Show team activities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;14.3 Project Progress&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Number of tasks.&lt;br&gt;• Completed tasks.&lt;br&gt;• Tasks in progress.&lt;br&gt;• Overdue tasks.&lt;br&gt;• Completion percentage." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="410" width="400" x="1300" y="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-16" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;15. Administration &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Organization and system administration&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;15.1 Organization Administration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Manage organization settings.&lt;br&gt;• Manage members.&lt;br&gt;• Manage teams.&lt;br&gt;• Manage workspaces.&lt;br&gt;• Manage roles.&lt;br&gt;• Monitor activities.&lt;br&gt;• Manage storage policies.&lt;br&gt;• Manage meeting recording policy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;15.2 System Administration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• View service status.&lt;br&gt;• Monitor Backend errors.&lt;br&gt;• Monitor Jobs.&lt;br&gt;• Monitor recording operations.&lt;br&gt;• Monitor storage.&lt;br&gt;• Monitor resource consumption.&lt;br&gt;• Manage system settings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;15.3 Audit Logs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Log login operations.&lt;br&gt;• Log permission changes.&lt;br&gt;• Log file deletions.&lt;br&gt;• Log access to recordings according to policy.&lt;br&gt;• Log approval of extracted tasks.&lt;br&gt;• Log administrative operations.&lt;br&gt;• View the operations log for the authorized administrator." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="450" width="400" x="1300" y="626" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-17" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;b&gt;16. Security &amp;amp; Privacy Functions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Security and privacy functions&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Identity verification.&lt;br&gt;• Permission verification.&lt;br&gt;• Session protection.&lt;br&gt;• Password protection.&lt;br&gt;• LiveKit token protection.&lt;br&gt;• Webhook verification.&lt;br&gt;• Resource ownership verification.&lt;br&gt;• File protection.&lt;br&gt;• Prevent access between workspaces.&lt;br&gt;• Protect API endpoints from abuse.&lt;br&gt;• Rate Limiting.&lt;br&gt;• Input validation.&lt;br&gt;• Protection against SQL Injection.&lt;br&gt;• Protection against XSS.&lt;br&gt;• Protection against CSRF where applicable to the authentication mechanism.&lt;br&gt;• Manage secrets in secure environment variables.&lt;br&gt;• Use HTTPS.&lt;br&gt;• Manage data retention policies.&lt;br&gt;• Delete user data according to organization policy.&lt;br&gt;• Request consent before recording and processing.&lt;br&gt;• Define access permissions for recordings and transcripts." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="400" x="1300" y="1092" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-18" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;b&gt;17. System &amp;amp; Background Processing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Internal system functions&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;17.1 Background Jobs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create a processing task.&lt;br&gt;• Put it in a Queue.&lt;br&gt;• Select a suitable Worker.&lt;br&gt;• Execute the task.&lt;br&gt;• Update task status.&lt;br&gt;• Retry.&lt;br&gt;• Log the error.&lt;br&gt;• Prevent duplicate execution.&lt;br&gt;• Finish the task.&lt;br&gt;• Clean up temporary files.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;17.2 Scheduled Tasks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Send meeting reminders.&lt;br&gt;• Send task reminders.&lt;br&gt;• Clean up temporary files.&lt;br&gt;• Manage expired data according to policy.&lt;br&gt;• Execute scheduled operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;17.3 System Monitoring&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Monitor API.&lt;br&gt;• Monitor Redis.&lt;br&gt;• Monitor PostgreSQL.&lt;br&gt;• Monitor MinIO.&lt;br&gt;• Monitor LiveKit.&lt;br&gt;• Monitor Workers.&lt;br&gt;• Log errors.&lt;br&gt;• Trace requests and operations.&lt;br&gt;• Measure response time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;17.4 Reliability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Handle service failures.&lt;br&gt;• Retry.&lt;br&gt;• Handle network interruptions.&lt;br&gt;• Recover stalled tasks.&lt;br&gt;• Handle duplicate Webhooks.&lt;br&gt;• Protect operations from unintended duplication." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="590" width="400" x="1300" y="1508" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-19" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="&lt;b&gt;18. User Experience &amp;amp; Interface&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;User experience functions&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Responsive interface.&lt;br&gt;• Support for desktop, tablet and phone.&lt;br&gt;• Sidebar navigation menu.&lt;br&gt;• Switch between workspaces.&lt;br&gt;• Organized project pages.&lt;br&gt;• Kanban interface.&lt;br&gt;• Chat interface.&lt;br&gt;• Meeting interface.&lt;br&gt;• Recordings interface.&lt;br&gt;• Meeting assistant interface.&lt;br&gt;• Loading states.&lt;br&gt;• Empty States.&lt;br&gt;• Error states.&lt;br&gt;• Success and failure messages.&lt;br&gt;• Confirmation of sensitive operations.&lt;br&gt;• Quick search.&lt;br&gt;• Basic shortcuts.&lt;br&gt;• Light and dark mode support.&lt;br&gt;• English and Arabic language support.&lt;br&gt;• RTL support for the Arabic interface when implemented.&lt;br&gt;• Accessibility considerations." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="400" x="1300" y="2114" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-20" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;19. Advanced &amp;amp; Future Functionalities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Future release functionalities&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;19.1 Collaborative Whiteboard&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create a whiteboard.&lt;br&gt;• Drawing.&lt;br&gt;• Add shapes.&lt;br&gt;• Add text.&lt;br&gt;• Simultaneous collaboration.&lt;br&gt;• Save the whiteboard.&lt;br&gt;• Link the whiteboard to a project or meeting.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;19.2 Advanced Calendar&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Personal calendar.&lt;br&gt;• Team calendar.&lt;br&gt;• Meeting scheduling.&lt;br&gt;• Recurring meetings.&lt;br&gt;• Conflict management.&lt;br&gt;• External calendar sync when needed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;19.3 Webinars &amp;amp; Events&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Create a Webinar.&lt;br&gt;• Manage registration.&lt;br&gt;• Manage speakers.&lt;br&gt;• Manage attendance.&lt;br&gt;• Show the broadcast.&lt;br&gt;• Record the event.&lt;br&gt;• Attendance reports.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;19.4 Advanced AI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Speaker identification (Diarization).&lt;br&gt;• Semantic search in meetings.&lt;br&gt;• Ask questions about a past meeting.&lt;br&gt;• Compare multiple meetings.&lt;br&gt;• Detect recurring topics.&lt;br&gt;• Extract historical decisions.&lt;br&gt;• Summarize long meetings in stages.&lt;br&gt;• Multi-language support.&lt;br&gt;• Improve Arabic dialect processing.&lt;br&gt;• Suggest tasks based on project context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;19.5 Advanced Analytics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Meeting statistics.&lt;br&gt;• Project statistics.&lt;br&gt;• Task completion indicators.&lt;br&gt;• Participation indicators.&lt;br&gt;• Platform usage indicators.&lt;br&gt;• Organization reports.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;19.6 Mobile Applications&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Android app.&lt;br&gt;• iOS app.&lt;br&gt;• Push notifications.&lt;br&gt;• Meeting participation.&lt;br&gt;• Task management.&lt;br&gt;• View recordings and summaries." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="820" width="400" x="1300" y="2530" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-21" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;20. MVP — Official First Release&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;These are the functionalities to focus on in the first release:&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;A. Identity &amp;amp; Workspace&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Registration.&lt;br&gt;• Login / Logout.&lt;br&gt;• Password Reset.&lt;br&gt;• Email Verification.&lt;br&gt;• User Profile.&lt;br&gt;• Workspace Creation.&lt;br&gt;• Workspace Members.&lt;br&gt;• Invitations.&lt;br&gt;• Basic RBAC.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;B. Collaboration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Teams.&lt;br&gt;• Projects.&lt;br&gt;• Channels.&lt;br&gt;• Direct Messages.&lt;br&gt;• Real-Time Messaging.&lt;br&gt;• Basic Notifications.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;C. Project Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Project Creation.&lt;br&gt;• Project Members.&lt;br&gt;• Task Creation.&lt;br&gt;• Task Assignment.&lt;br&gt;• Task Status.&lt;br&gt;• Kanban Board.&lt;br&gt;• Task Comments.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;D. File Management&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Upload.&lt;br&gt;• Download.&lt;br&gt;• Delete.&lt;br&gt;• Basic Organization.&lt;br&gt;• Permissions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;E. Meetings&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Meeting Creation.&lt;br&gt;• Meeting Joining.&lt;br&gt;• LiveKit Integration.&lt;br&gt;• Audio / Video.&lt;br&gt;• Screen Sharing.&lt;br&gt;• Participant Management.&lt;br&gt;• Recording.&lt;br&gt;• Meeting History.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;F. AI Meeting Assistant&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Recording Processing.&lt;br&gt;• Whisper Transcription.&lt;br&gt;• Transcript Storage.&lt;br&gt;• AI Summary.&lt;br&gt;• Decision Extraction.&lt;br&gt;• Action Item Extraction.&lt;br&gt;• Human Review.&lt;br&gt;• Task Creation from Approved Action Items.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;G. System&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Redis.&lt;br&gt;• BullMQ.&lt;br&gt;• Workers.&lt;br&gt;• MinIO.&lt;br&gt;• PostgreSQL.&lt;br&gt;• Docker Compose.&lt;br&gt;• Basic Monitoring.&lt;br&gt;• Unit &amp;amp; Integration Testing." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="980" width="400" x="40" y="3306" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-22" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" value="&lt;b&gt;21. Out of MVP Scope&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The following functionalities are postponed to avoid project bloat:&lt;br&gt;• Advanced Whiteboard.&lt;br&gt;• Advanced Calendar.&lt;br&gt;• Webinars.&lt;br&gt;• Mobile Applications.&lt;br&gt;• Advanced Analytics.&lt;br&gt;• Semantic Search.&lt;br&gt;• Training a custom AI model.&lt;br&gt;• Many external integrations.&lt;br&gt;• Complex enterprise management system.&lt;br&gt;• Billing and subscriptions system." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="400" x="880" y="3306" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mDeQGMzjkuG4_2jXmyQS-23" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;22. MVP Definition of Done&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The first release is not considered complete merely because all the pages exist.&lt;br&gt;It must succeed in the following end-to-end scenario:&lt;br&gt;1. A user creates an account.&lt;br&gt;2. Creates a Workspace.&lt;br&gt;3. Invites other members.&lt;br&gt;4. Creates a Project.&lt;br&gt;5. Creates a Channel linked to the project.&lt;br&gt;6. Members communicate via messages.&lt;br&gt;7. The user creates a Task and assigns it.&lt;br&gt;8. Creates a meeting linked to the project.&lt;br&gt;9. Participants join the meeting.&lt;br&gt;10. Camera, microphone and screen sharing work.&lt;br&gt;11. The meeting is recorded.&lt;br&gt;12. The recording is saved in MinIO.&lt;br&gt;13. A Webhook is sent after recording completes.&lt;br&gt;14. A Worker starts processing the recording.&lt;br&gt;15. Whisper extracts the text.&lt;br&gt;16. The LLM creates the summary, decisions and suggested tasks.&lt;br&gt;17. The user reviews the results.&lt;br&gt;18. The user approves the correct tasks.&lt;br&gt;19. The tasks appear in the Kanban Board.&lt;br&gt;20. Members can track their execution.&lt;br&gt;If this scenario succeeds reliably, NexaMeet has achieved the core of its idea." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="460" width="400" x="1300" y="3366" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>

